  "title": "Kirby Problem 3.64",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let A be a flat connection on the trivial $\\operatorname{SU}(2)$ bundle on a closed three-manifold M. The Chern--Simons invariant $\\operatorname{CS}(M, A)$ is defined to be\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{CS}(M,A)=\\frac{1}{4\\pi^2}\\int_M \\operatorname{Tr}\\!\\left(A\\wedge dA+\\frac{2}{3}A\\wedge A\\wedge A\\right).\n$$\n Is $\\operatorname{CS}(M, A)$ always rational?",
